{
  "dom_id": "step-18852",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Solving Logarithmic Equations",
  "problem": "If $\\log_2 x = 5,$ then what is the value of $x?$",
  "worked_solution": "To remove the logarithm, we exponentiate both sides of the equation. The base of the logarithm is $2,$ so we use a base of $2$ for the exponentiation as well:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{log}_{2}⁡x & =5 \\\\ {2}^{{log}_{2}⁡x} & ={2}^{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since exponentiation is the inverse function of the logarithm, we know that $2^{\\log_2 x} = x.$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={2}^{5} \\\\ x & =32.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-18852\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"18852\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"5118\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-18852\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-2\">Solving Logarithmic Equations</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"18852\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n     